cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use neonmux in your work or build on it, please cite it as below."
title: neonmux
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ricardo
    family-names: Carmona
abstract: >-
  A GPU terminal multiplexer written in Go on Ebitengine: tiled and floating
  panes, a file explorer, an image viewer and an audio player in a single
  window, with persistent sessions and pixel-art themes.
keywords:
  - terminal
  - terminal-multiplexer
  - go
  - ebitengine
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ThiraSoft/neonmux"
